I found the calendar "Leo on-call" with ID `leo-oncall@northwind.example`. Now I need to create an ACL rule to share it with Priya Nair. Based on the email patterns in this organization (firstname.lastname@northwind.example), Priya Nair's email would be `priya.nair@northwind.example`. Let me create the sharing rule.

<action>
curl -s -X POST "https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/leo-oncall%40northwind.example/acl?sendNotifications=true" -H "Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
  "scope": {
    "type": "user",
    "value": "priya.nair@northwind.example"
  },
  "role": "reader"
}'
</action>

